                {
                  "text": "2 Sur 3:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afa piriru ’diyi ma alu ma zoza ovu wuale mudri drini aro, ombo erini o’bizu le baka wuale mudri drini iri, piza erini ovu drianzi sule, aleni eri pirini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dri molaru ovu drinia, dri nde ma zoza uruleru ovu wuale towi, emba onyiafaruri ovu dri nde ma ageia kuru pomegranateni be, yi dria molaru. Afa piriru iriri ovu vini afa onyiafaru be tro tro ’diyile, pomegranateni be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
